{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Hard as Hell",
    "steam_appid": 3100500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100500/extras/4f2a9cb7bc5839a2eba1b24bcd903fa6.avif?t=1729853136\" width=620 height=140 /></span><strong>Hard as Hell</strong> is a game where you play as a store owner trying to make ends meet in the bustling C.R.T. City in the year 1999. However, a wave of goons overtake the vulnerable city, and you\u2019re forced to defend your store against waves of destructive enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending FPS and tower defence mechanics, <strong>Hard as Hell</strong> lets you explore C.R.T. city at night, gathering resources and recruiting volunteers to fortify your shop. During the day, you\u2019ll fight off waves of attackers from either the roof of your store or down in the streets, engaging in close combat. In <strong>Hard as Hell\u00a0</strong>you must hold out for eight days, with each day becoming more challenging as the attackers grow in strength and numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100500/extras/d404993947930557b800b3de46316761.avif?t=1729853136\" width=620 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay draws inspiration from classic 90s FPS titles, delivering that nostalgic feel. Don your bandana, and fight to protect your store in this intense gauntlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various weaponry to blast goons with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Smoking cigarettes to heal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Recruit allies to give you cover from atop rooftops </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylistic/Artistic scenery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Robust gunplay and action </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Craft bandanas to give unique perks </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100500/extras/4f2a9cb7bc5839a2eba1b24bcd903fa6.avif?t=1729853136\" width=620 height=140 /></span><strong>Hard as Hell</strong> is a game where you play as a store owner trying to make ends meet in the bustling C.R.T. City in the year 1999. However, a wave of goons overtake the vulnerable city, and you\u2019re forced to defend your store against waves of destructive enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending FPS and tower defence mechanics, <strong>Hard as Hell</strong> lets you explore C.R.T. city at night, gathering resources and recruiting volunteers to fortify your shop. During the day, you\u2019ll fight off waves of attackers from either the roof of your store or down in the streets, engaging in close combat. In <strong>Hard as Hell\u00a0</strong>you must hold out for eight days, with each day becoming more challenging as the attackers grow in strength and numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100500/extras/d404993947930557b800b3de46316761.avif?t=1729853136\" width=620 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay draws inspiration from classic 90s FPS titles, delivering that nostalgic feel. Don your bandana, and fight to protect your store in this intense gauntlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various weaponry to blast goons with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Smoking cigarettes to heal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Recruit allies to give you cover from atop rooftops </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylistic/Artistic scenery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Robust gunplay and action </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Craft bandanas to give unique perks </p>",
    "short_description": "It's 1999, and C.R.T. City has plunged into chaos. The crime ridden city has been devastated by vandalism, theft, and destruction... But the tired populous band together. Protect your store, property, and pride from the angry masses, in this blend of a Tower Defence and FPS.",
